19:56:00","session_id":"session_10","session_index":10,"source_sha256":"d3fc7c33c05db5eca371e70521ab442fe0f48c0ef47ea8fd13a6391ee725a48f","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin, how's the car doing after the crash? You were stoked to get back on the road, right?\n[S10T1] (dia_id: D10:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! Thanks for checking in. It's all good now, the car's fixed and going strong. Nothing better than cruising around - it's the best! Look at how my car looks right now. How've you been? Anything new?\n[Image caption: a photography of a red sports car parked on the side of the road]\n[S10T2] (dia_id: D10:2)\n\nDave: Glad to hear your car's fixed and going strong! I've been good too. Just been hanging out with friends at parks lately. I arranged with friends for regular walks together in the park.\n[S10T3] (dia_id: D10:3)\n\nCalvin: \nThat sounds like a great plan! Regular walks with friends can be a wonderful way to spend time together and stay active. Fresh air and buddies can do wonders. Do you have a favorite spot for hanging out?\n[S10T4] (dia_id: D10:4)\n\nDave: Yeah, today we are going to that spot. Look at that lovely photo.\n[Image caption: a photo of a city skyline with a river and boats in the water]\n[S10T5] (dia_id: D10:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, what a view! That sunset over the river is gorgeous. It must be so tranquil there. Reminds me of living in my Japanese mansion with the epic cityscape. It's like a dream come true! Look at this photo I took from my backyard of the mansion. It's so beautiful!\n[Image caption: a photo of a boat is docked in a canal at sunset]\n[S10T6] (dia_id: D10:6)\n\nDave: Yeah, the peace by the river is really nice. But living in a Japanese mansion surrounded by that city skyline must be stunning. The views must be amazing!\n[S10T7] (dia_id: D10:7)\n\nCalvin: Ah, it really is beautiful. Whenever I look out the windows and see the city lights, it's so awe-inspiring. Luxury and beauty on a whole new level. Look at the front part of the mansion.\n[Image caption: a photo of a large house with a lot of windows and lights]\n[S10T8] (dia_id: D10:8)","text_sha256":"ebd8e55a8dd9bce6451a3a6065f82c919f526df670b23ff467cb36a04470b8aa","timestamp":"2023-07-07T19:56:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D10:1","D10:2","D10:3","D10:5","D10:6","D10:7","D10:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":215,"line_start":215,"source_locators":["[S10T1]","[S10T2]","[S10T3]","[S10T5]","[S10T6]","[S10T7]","[S10T8]"],"text_sha256":"b09d29378f130c99c670fc80c16e5aece2a59dce836672e4ee7271887beebe33"},{"dia_ids":["D10:9","D10:10","D10:11","D10:12","D10:13","D10:14","D10:15","D10:16","D10:17"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":216,"line_start":216,"source_locators":["[S10T9]","[S10T10]","[S10T11]","[S10T12]","[S10T13]","[S10T14]","[S10T15]","[S10T16]","[S10T17]"],"text_sha256":"6e409302478f00407ab628edfe927b3e57397abad30c5383f16a4b5e63dea3f2"},{"dia_ids":["D12:1","D12:2","D12:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":217,"line_start":217,"source_locators":["[S12T1]","[S12T2]","[S12T3]"],"text_sha256":"b3f3adb9ca636a35a4c60c85ba98e7ddeadde702d91b15ec7686b5af6f04d6b4"},{"dia_ids":["D12:4","D12:5","D12:6","D12:7","D12:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":218,"line_start":218,"source_locators":["[S12T4]","[S12T5]","[S12T6]","[S12T7]","[S12T8]"],"text_sha256":"e1c0bcfc1f54577c5ca6e7abc8a1b5bdb01621af803806191b8b6c9f1fed8406"},{"dia_ids":["D11:1","D11:4","D11:6","D11:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":219,"line_start":219,"source_locators":["[S11T1]","[S11T4]","[S11T6]","[S11T8]"],"text_sha256":"36844baca057ab995ecdff8121fe294db1244aac67d2839213e05261082cb568"}],"dia_ids":["D10:1","D10:2","D10:3","D10:5","D10:6","D10:7","D10:8","D10:9","D10:10","D10:11","D10:12","D10:13","D10:14","D10:15","D10:16","D10:17","