00","session_id":"session_11","session_index":11,"source_sha256":"d9b83c0da832c6a5680bcc0308d8370d72575afface2f641828f667bb6073d31","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-07-07, caught up with Dave: Dave asked how the car was doing after the crash, and Calvin said it's all good now — fixed and going strong — sharing a photo of the red sports car parked on the side of the road (details in ## Car accident (2023-06-16)). Dave said he's been hanging out with friends at parks; Calvin shared photos of his mansion's backyard (a boat docked in a canal at sunset) and the mansion front, and Dave marveled at the views from the Japanese mansion (details in ## New home (2023-03-23)) [S10T1][S10T2][S10T3][S10T5][S10T6][S10T7][S10T8].\n- The 2023-07-07 conversation continued: Calvin is looking forward to trying the Japanese food and checking out the culture; when Dave said he has never been to Japan but is \"so keen to go one day\" and is \"hooked on\" Japanese music, Calvin said Japan \"definitely has it all\" — vibes, food, tech, and an amazing culture, \"like stepping into another world\" — and told him he's working on music collaborations with Japanese artists; Dave can't wait for the tunes, and Calvin promised to share clips and \"can't wait to show you\" the results. The conversation closed with Calvin thanking Dave, \"Appreciate all the help\", and saying \"Great catching up, gotta get back to work now. Take care!\" (Dave's Japan travel interest is in /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S10T9][S10T10][S10T11][S10T12][S10T13][S10T14][S10T15][S10T16]. Dave's final sign-off: \"Hey Cal, take care and don't overwork yourself! Talk to you soon. Stay safe!\" [S10T17].\n- On 2023-08-03, reconnected with Dave (\"long time no see!\"): told him the recent Ferrari service was so stressful and that he's attached to the car, and asked what kind of hobbies give Dave a feeling of being restored; Dave said fixing cars is like therapy for him and shared his fond memories of working on cars with his dad as a kid (details in /memories/dave.md > ## Hobbies and sense of purpose) [S12T1][S12T2][S12T3].\n- The 2023-08-03 conversation continued: Dave shared a childhood photo of himself and his dad (a man and a child posing), which Calvin found cool (\"Reminiscing is always fun!\"); Calvin then shared a photo of his red Ferrari on a lift in a garage, saying his car is the best — \"Sure, it's just material, but it reminds me of my hard work and dedication\"; Dave said the car looks great, \"I can tell why you're proud,\" and that it's \"like a reminder of what you can achieve\" (details of the car in ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26)) [S12T4][S12T5][S12T6][S12T7][S12T8].\n- On 2023-07-21, caught up with Dave (\"been ages since we spoke!\"): Dave told him he'd just returned from a road trip with friends (details in /memories/dave.md) and asked what Calvin had been up to; Calvin told him about the recording-studio project in the Japanese mansion, shared a progress photo, said he's been experimenting with electronic elements, and discussed the challenge of balancing his signature sound with new styles (details in ## Recording studio (2023-07-21)) [S11T1][S11T4][S11T6][S11T8].","text_sha256":"ae99d0a8c39a18abb72e5b6fcfa7037441affbc11f7efcad60f1eeb9072d2310","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D9:11","D9:13","D9:14","D9:15"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":22,"line_start":22,"source_locators":["[S9T11]","[S9T13]","[S9T14]","[S9T15]"],"text_sha256":"d6e045026f5838bfea3a4a938c3130a3edbc4951fe957e40000107dda4a36be4"},{"dia_ids":["D10:6"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":23,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S10T6]"],"text_sha256":"602b4020de5fd1f90143be3991072ba412b35195d2539729052c14439b206122"},{"dia_ids":["D10:10"],"ki