believably stunning\"; can't wait to see it in person [S9T11][S9T13][S9T14][S9T15].\n- As of 2023-07-07, still living in Japan — his home is a Japanese mansion with an epic cityscape (see ## New home (2023-03-23)) [S10T6].\n- As of 2023-07-07, looking forward to trying the Japanese food and checking out the culture — \"Japan is indeed amazing\" [S10T10].\n- As of 2023-07-07, is working on music collaborations with Japanese artists (a continuation of his plan to collaborate with musicians in the area, see above) — \"really excited to hear how it turns out\"; promised Dave he'll share some clips when everything's ready; says collaborating with various artists is \"always exciting, it's a chance to create something unique\" [S10T12][S10T14].\n- On 2023-09-22, said his trip to Japan was incredible — \"the culture, the people, everything was so cool\" — and \"I'm already longing to go back, it was an experience that made all the hard work worth it.\" [S20T4].","text_sha256":"dbb2404a47ae4736512b30abdc6525a90cd87e2a5e16535b80beb65de59cb426","timestamp":null}],"protocol_version":"e7-deterministic-fusion-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What was Calvin excited to do after getting his car fixed on 7 July, 2023?","question_id":"conv-50-q088","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":32,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"1bbd30d3e3ccd155f9a947ee7bc2ca0c5c217b544e6acf2df902655adfca14ab","retrieval_id":"fusion","retrieval_metrics":{"completion_tokens":2223,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":8,"orchestration_calls":8,"prompt_tokens":44939,"provider_request_attempts":8,"provider_rounds":8,"reused_upstream_retrieval":true,"search_calls":0,"source_bundle_count":2,"total_tokens":47162},"schema_version":1,"source_bundle_ids":["bundle-a4176a2325fb9e588d8ea5f9d90cbeaa8ff40f368a7c2a2acedf38a64306094d","bundle-114fdbc6f162b21d37ddd15ae8bf74ba8abe97749526cdaee78408f13e6637cb"],"source_conditions":["E2","E6"],"source_statuses":["capped","capp